585:     /// should be inserted.
586:     ///
587:     /// For example, if self.current_row_id is 10 and the deletion vector is [11, 12, 19, 25] and
588:     /// num_rows is 7 then this function will at least return [1, 2] and the batch will at least
589:     /// span row ids 10..18.
